@startuml
title Web UI Scenario: Save Current Grid Text to grids/

actor Player
participant "Web UI page (holds current grid text)" as WebUI
participant "Flask HTTP Request Handler" as Handler
participant "Game Engine Text Codec" as Codec
participant "Flask Grid File I/O" as Files
participant "File System (grids/ folder)" as FS
participant "Flask Page Renderer" as Renderer

autonumber

Player -> WebUI: enter file name and request save
WebUI -> Handler: HTTP save request with grid text and file name
Handler -> Codec: validate supplied grid text
Codec --> Handler: valid grid or invalid-grid error
Handler -> Files: write supplied grid text to named file in grids/
Files -> FS: write plain text file in grids/
FS --> Files: write confirmed
Files --> Handler: save result
Handler -> Renderer: render confirmation or error
Renderer --> WebUI: HTTP response with page
WebUI --> Player: confirmation or clear error message
@enduml
